{"repositoryId":692873778,"availability":"available","full":"nuxt/a11y","name":"a11y","description":"Nuxt module to provide accessibility hinting and utilities.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":233,"forks":8,"created":"2023-09-17T20:53:28Z","updated":"2026-10-13T17:14:55Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["a11y","accessibility","nuxt","nuxt-module"],"demo":"https://stackblitz.com/github/nuxt/a11y?file=playground%2Fapp.vue","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:10.174Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:10.174Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:10.174Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T16:01:10.174Z","stars":233,"forks":8}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[][npm-version-href] [][npm-downloads-href] [][license-href] [][nuxt-href] [](","A Nuxt module that provides real-time accessibility feedback and automated testing right in your browser during development.","Nuxt Accessibility integrates directly into the Nuxt DevTools, giving you actionable insights to fix WCAG violations, improve accessibility compliance, and ensure your application is usable by everyone without ever leaving your development environment."],"features":["🔍 Rich DevTools UI: A tab in Nuxt DevTools to visualize accessibility violations, inspect elements, and get recommendations.","⚡️ Powered by axe-core: Industry-leading accessibility testing engine used by Google, Microsoft, and thousands of developers worldwide.","🎨 Element Highlighting: Click any violation to highlight and pin affected elements on your page with numbered badges.","🎯 Impact-Based Organization: Violations categorized by severity (critical, serious, moderate, minor) to help you prioritize fixes.","🔄 Results based on Routes: Automatically tracks violations across all routes as you navigate your application."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nuxt/a11y/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ed531f1d564e81c96c2ff5979fefc7a81b22a4a8216fc6a7c23